  {system: "SGLang", url: "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang", overlap: "shipping serving/runtime framework with RadixAttention prefix caching, structured outputs, speculative decoding, schedulers; no found partial-tool-result early-commit policy or correctness-safety break-even"},
